= Science
{parent=}
{wiki}

Systematic inquiry into the world through publicly assessable reasoning, <observation> and, where appropriate, <experiment>. Historical practices and institutions differ; this working characterization is not a claim that the modern professional category existed unchanged in every period.

= Observation
{parent=Science}
{wiki}

A disciplined record or judgment made through sensory or instrumental interaction with an object or event. An <observation> has conditions of production and interpretation; it is distinct from a deliberate experimental intervention.

